          "Hadith.3610 - A man said to Abu al-Hasan Imam Musa ibn Jafar Al-Kadhim (as):\n\"Promise me something.\"\nImam (as) replied: \"How can I promise you, when I have more hope in what I do not expect than in what I do expect?\""
